# Standalone test artifacts / probes / scratch scripts —
# leading-underscore convention marks throwaway investigation
# tooling from interactive sessions. They shouldn't pollute the
# repo but kept locally so a session can resume work.
# NOTE: ignoring these does NOT keep them out of the installer. The Nunba
# build syncs root modules with os.listdir() + endswith('.py'), reading the
# filesystem rather than git, so every _*.py here still ships. See
# scripts/build.py, "Sync top-level HARTOS .py modules".
/_*.py
/_*.txt
/_*.md
/_*.json
/_*.jsonl
/_*.png
/_*.jpg
/_*.html
/_drops_ready/

# npm deps inside vendored channel adapters
integrations/channels/*/node_modules/

# Runtime trading + capture logs
integrations/trading/paper_trades.jsonl

# Runtime PID file written by the agent daemon on first start
agent.pid
